OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 19, hit and killed by car
OL,4,Aoutside hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old woman has died after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a car outside a Merseyside
OL,8,Fhospital.
OL,10,FShe was struck near the accident and
OL,11,Femergency department of Arrowe Park
OL,12,FHospital, Wirral, on Tuesday at 22:25
OL,13,FGMT, police said.
OL,15,FThe woman, who is from the Wirral area,
OL,16,Fwas treated by hospital staff but died
OL,17,Fat the scene, Merseyside Police said.
OL,18,FHer next of kin have been informed.
OL,20,FThe female driver of the car stayed at
OL,21,Fthe scene and "assisted" officers
OL,22,Finvestigating the death.
